{"id":"language\/v1beta2\/entity","type":"","title":"Google\\Cloud\\Language\\V1beta2\\Entity","name":"Entity","description":"<p>Represents a phrase in the text that is a known entity, such as\na person, an organization, or location. The API associates information, such\nas salience and mentions, with entities.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"methods":[{"id":"__construct","type":"constructor","name":"__construct","source":"Language\/src\/V1beta2\/Entity.php#L99","description":"<p>Constructor.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"data","description":"<p>Optional. Data for populating the Message object.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.name\n","description":"<p>The representative name for the entity.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.type\n","description":"<p>The entity type.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.integer.php\" target=\"_blank\">int<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.metadata\n","description":"<p>Metadata associated with the entity. For most entity types, the metadata is a Wikipedia URL (<code>wikipedia_url<\/code>) and Knowledge Graph MID (<code>mid<\/code>), if they are available. For the metadata associated with other entity types, see the Type table below.<\/p>","types":["|"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"data.salience\n","description":"<p>The salience score associated with the entity in the [0, 1.0] range. The salience score for an entity provides information about the importance or centrality of that entity to the entire document text. Scores closer to 0 are less salient, while scores closer to 1.0 are highly salient.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.float.php\" target=\"_